OL,3,GNEWSAEx-head's guilty plea prompts
OL,4,Acalls for 'reassurance'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors and an MP have called for a
OL,7,Fmeeting to reassure parents on
OL,8,Fsafeguarding issues after a former head
OL,9,Fteacher admitted a charge of possessing
OL,10,Findecent images.
OL,12,FDudley Council said there were no plans
OL,13,Ffor a meeting with parents at Brockmoor
OL,14,Fand Brierley Hill primary schools after
OL,15,FRussell Bond, 41, pleaded guilty to
OL,16,Fpossessing the images in August.
OL,18,FWhen asked whether there had been an
OL,19,Finvestigation into safeguarding, the
OL,20,FLocal Democracy Reporting Service
OL,21,F(LDRS) was referred to a statement from
OL,22,Fthe school governors.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
