OL,3,GNEWSAEx-head's guilty plea prompts
OL,4,Acalls for 'reassurance'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe statement included that police said
OL,7,Fno children from the schools were
OL,8,Finvolved in the offence, and Bond was
OL,9,Fprohibited from school premises after
OL,10,Fhis arrest.
